  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Tarciana Paula Gomes Medeiros (born 1978) is a Brazilian economist and business executive. In January 2023 she was appointed as CEO of Banco do Brasil (BB), the second-largest bank in Brazil and Latin America, which is controlled by the Brazilian government. In 2023 she was considered by Forbes magazine to be the 24th most-powerful woman in the world.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
